                                                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Treatmant plan"@en .


###  https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/NIOSH-ControlOntology#AdministrativeControl
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/NIOSH-ControlOntology#AdministrativeControl> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                        rdfs:subClassOf <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/NIOSH-ControlOntology#Control> ;
                                                                                        <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2024-05-15"^^xsd:date ;
                                                                                        <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Nick McDonald" ;
